## Main-owned research artifact check

The following paths are research artifacts or human-facing narrative files. Because all workers are Codex sub-agents, there is no "non-Codex fallback." If an issue's `file_scope` intersects this list, split the implementation from the research-artifact update unless the user explicitly asked the worker to edit that artifact.

**Main-owned paths by default**:

- `src/scripts/plot_*.py` — result plotting scripts (codex's plot aesthetics are bad)
- `**/result.md` — research record of truth
- `doc/**` — paper LaTeX
- `proposal.md` — project nucleus
- `survey.md` — verified related work
- `log/**` — project timeline entries
- `doc/figures/*.tex` — hand-drawn TikZ schematics

**Decisions made for this batch** (filled by dispatcher):

